<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">making me want you</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;The first time Catra sees Adora, itâ€™s a glance of gold in the corner of her eye that brings her mind to the middle of summer and the fields of barley a few miles out the backdoor of her familyâ€™s estate. Itâ€™s the scent of lilacs that follows their skin like ribbons of silk; Catra feels her own heart thump within her ribcage at the memories of the bunches that hang from the kitchenâ€™s window cill. Itâ€™s every way their voice is soft as they take a little breath, as though theyâ€™re stunned. Perhaps understandably. Before Adora offers a bemused, â€œHi.â€ &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Catra was certain that whatever tapestries they made of this moment in generations to come, itâ€™s the way her eyes drifted to meet Adoraâ€™s that would be the very first touch of thread onto that blank canvas. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;And itâ€™s tragic. Because, looking as handsome as sin in their white and gold naval accoutre, Adoraâ€™s standing before her, and Catra doesnâ€™t even know.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Adertily</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
